### 2. `StripeConfig` Uses `@ConfigurationProperties` on a `@Configuration` Class — Naming Mismatch

> [!WARNING]
> **File:** [StripeConfig.java](file:///d:/Projects/QuitApp/backend/src/main/java/com/unshackled/api/config/StripeConfig.java)

The `stripe.price-id` in `application.yml` maps to the field name `premiumPriceId` but `@ConfigurationProperties` uses kebab-to-camelCase via relaxed binding for `price-id` → `priceId`, NOT `premiumPriceId`. The field is named `premiumPriceId` but the YAML key is `price-id`. **This will bind to `null` at runtime.**

**Fix:** Either rename the field to `priceId` or change the YAML key to `premium-price-id`.

