### 4. Global Stats Cache is NOT Thread-Safe Despite `synchronized`

> [!WARNING]
> **File:** [AnalyticsService.java](file:///d:/Projects/QuitApp/backend/src/main/java/com/unshackled/api/service/AnalyticsService.java#L42-L44)

```java
private com.unshackled.api.dto.GlobalStats cachedStats = null;
private long lastCacheUpdate = 0;
```

These fields are mutable non-volatile instance fields on a Spring singleton. While `getGlobalStats()` is `synchronized`, `cachedStats` is read from `getDashboardSummary()` potentially without synchronization. This is a **visibility** issue.

Similarly in `LeaderboardService.java` — same pattern with `cachedGlobalLeaderboard`.

**Fix:** Use `volatile` on cache fields, or use `AtomicReference` + `ConcurrentHashMap`-based caching, or Spring's `@Cacheable`.

