### 7. `ChallengeService.getChallengeHistory()` — Mutating Unmodifiable List

> [!WARNING]
> **File:** [ChallengeService.java](file:///d:/Projects/QuitApp/backend/src/main/java/com/unshackled/api/service/ChallengeService.java#L226-L233)

```java
List<ChallengeModel> sent = challengeRepository.findByChallengerId(uId);
List<ChallengeModel> received = challengeRepository.findByChallengedId(uId);
sent.addAll(received);  // 💥 This can throw UnsupportedOperationException
```

If `jdbcTemplate.query()` returns an unmodifiable list implementation (it varies by JDBC driver/Spring version), calling `addAll()` will throw. Even if it currently works, it's fragile.

**Fix:** Create a new `ArrayList<>()` and add both lists to it:
```java
List<ChallengeModel> all = new ArrayList<>(sent);
all.addAll(received);
```

