### 9. `BadgeModel.triggerValue` — Type Mismatch with Schema

> [!WARNING]  
> **File:** [BadgeModel.java](file:///d:/Projects/QuitApp/backend/src/main/java/com/unshackled/api/model/BadgeModel.java)

The DB schema defines `trigger_value NUMERIC`, but the model uses `Integer triggerValue`. This loses precision for `money_saved` badges (e.g., `trigger_value: 1000` or `10000` are fine as integers, but the type mismatch could cause issues with JDBC mapping if a decimal value is ever stored).

**Fix:** Use `BigDecimal` for `triggerValue` to match the schema, and update `BadgeService` accordingly.

