Spring Boot auto-configures an `ObjectMapper` with JSR-310 date/time modules. Creating a new one bypasses that configuration. Same issue in [ChallengeService.java](file:///d:/Projects/QuitApp/backend/src/main/java/com/unshackled/api/service/ChallengeService.java#L44).

