### 16. `DailyReminderJob` — Uses UTC Hour but Users Set Times in Their Local Timezone

> [!NOTE]
> **File:** [DailyReminderJob.java](file:///d:/Projects/QuitApp/backend/src/main/java/com/unshackled/api/scheduler/DailyReminderJob.java#L31)

The job compares `daily_reminder_time` against the current UTC hour. But users set reminder times in their local timezone. The schema's `daily_reminder_time TIME DEFAULT '09:00:00'` doesn't include timezone info. If a user in IST sets 9:00 AM, the system treats it as 9:00 AM UTC (which is 2:30 PM IST).

**Fix:** Either store reminder times as UTC (convert on the frontend), or add timezone to the user model and adjust during the query.

