### 25. `UserRepository.findAcceptedFriends()` — Potential Duplicate Rows

> [!NOTE]
> **File:** [UserRepository.java](file:///d:/Projects/QuitApp/backend/src/main/java/com/unshackled/api/repository/UserRepository.java#L174-L183)

The SQL JOIN condition could return the same user twice if they appear as both `requester_id` and `addressee_id` in different friend records. While UNIQUE(requester_id, addressee_id) prevents exact duplicates, the OR condition in the JOIN can still yield duplicate users.

**Fix:** Add `DISTINCT` to the query: `SELECT DISTINCT u.* FROM users u ...`

